        "original_id": "e80cb780-5c87-5042-a770-c53a73dbc1c7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Emerald Wand of Oz, Trouble Under Oz\n- People: William Stout, Eric Shanower, L. Frank Baum\n- Companies: HarperCollins, News Corp\n- Places: New York City\n- Concepts: Oz series\n\nFacts:\n- In 1900, L. Frank Baum originally started the Oz series.\n- In 2005, The Emerald Wand of Oz was published as a continuation of the Oz series.\n- The Emerald Wand of Oz is illustrated by William Stout.\n- HarperCollins published The Emerald Wand of Oz.\n- Trouble Under Oz is a sequel to the 2005 novel The Emerald Wand of Oz.\n- Trouble Under Oz is a further continuation of the Oz series.\n- HarperCollins is headquartered in New York City.\n- HarperCollins is a subsidiary of News Corp.",
